				"type": "ExplorerScreenProps",
				"required": true,
				"description": "The host's props for one screen: `route` gives the tab that chooses the branch, `lens` answers the entity's relations, evidence and behavior, `scope` gives the commit the tabs are bound to (the source tab falls back to it when the entity has no `lastAt`), and `mediaBase` and `index.sourceRepository` go to the media panels and the source tab. The whole object goes to `entityShown`, `entityMetricComparison`, `helperRelations` and `EntityRelations`, and it is spread into `ExplorerPermissionsScreen` on an API's permissions tab."
			},
